spettacolare.\n\nGrazie al suo carisma, alle sue abilità fisiche e a una carriera ricca di successi internazionali, Jason Statham si è affermato come uno degli attori d'azione più popolari e riconoscibili del XXI secolo.","birthday":"1967-07-26","checked_at":"2026-11-26","deathday":"","filmography":[{"character":"Mason","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/drZmD0QO2E08Rqa5S9ko2pTmzhe.jpg","title":"Missione Shelter","tmdb_id":1290821,"type":"movie","year":2026},{"character":"Cole Reed","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/o4MXnSWwOnA4kftJ3NwZTIw2PuY.jpg","title":"Mutiny - Inverti la rotta","tmdb_id":1288445,"type":"movie","year":2026},{"character":"Levon Cade","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/svSRfBNmZjDnus65gZJovFNa63R.jpg","title":"A Working Man","tmdb_id":1197306,"type":"movie","year":2025},{"character":"Adam Clay","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/ctJLZO2E4gWkSwXG06y9bE2jfTN.jpg","title":"The Beekeeper","tmdb_id":866398,"type":"movie","year":2024},{"character":"Shaw","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/hC6mLdlgpFU63FOduX80xaGevGj.jpg","title":"Fast X","tmdb_id":385687,"type":"movie","year":2023},{"character":"Lee Christmas","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/do0esctPQkePprjtmtfkaaL7AQv.jpg","title":"I mercen4ri - Expendables","tmdb_id":299054,"type":"movie","year":2023},{"character":"Orson Fortune","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/u4CstvYG6BzfzP3UfY3c1Z0hz7o.jpg","title":"Operation Fortune","tmdb_id":739405,"type":"movie","year":2023},{"character":"Jonas Taylor","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/aXLb2YWXEammySGBh0m6aELmaNq.jpg","title":"Shark 2 - L'abisso","tmdb_id":615656,"type":"movie","year":2023},{"character":"Self (archive footage) (uncredited)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/7bR9zke8YOs4U0VeQLCpKRbPqjE.jpg","title":"Sly","tmdb_id":1146302,"type":"movie","year":2023},{"character":"Deckard Shaw (uncredited)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/o17wrpF3m9w2blQjglcFd5japvV.jpg","title":"F